# Agent changelog

Before finishing a PR or substantial change, append a short dated entry at
the top of `AGENT_CHANGELOG.md`.

Include:

- what changed and why
- the main files
- follow-ups the next agent needs

Also tick the changelog checkbox in `.github/PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE.md`.

Do not skip this for “small” PRs. Other agents use the file as the running
history of the repo.
